        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold mb-4">LDS Headstone Symbols &amp; Their Meaning</h1>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-lg max-w-3xl">Washington County is home to one of the highest concentrations of Latter-day Saint families in the country. The symbols families choose for headstones here — two temples, state symbols with scriptural roots, pioneer heritage motifs — carry specific meaning that runs deeper than decoration. This guide explains each one.</p>
